tle": "092111125 Bab4", "url": "https://eprints.walisongo.ac.id/id/eprint/1063/5/092111125_Bab4.pdf"}, {"title": "journal.uin-alauddin.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.uin-alauddin.ac.id/index.php/elfalaky/article/view/14166/8510"}, {"title": "Kategori Berita", "url": "https://inet.detik.com/read/2019/12/23/111834/4833043/511/gerhana-matahari-cincin-pernah-terjadi-di-masa-rasulullah-ini-ceritanya"}]}, "The search didn't find a KBBI entry for \"sepenggalah matahari\" with a \"kira-kira pukul\" time. The closest match is a mirror of the KBBI entry for *matahari* on typoonline.com, which lists a related idiom, \"matahari naik,\" as a time marker of roughly 08.00 to 09.00. The word \"sepenggalah\" shows up only as a fragment in that entry, so the result doesn't confirm its meaning. Other results were unrelated, such as an entry for *senja* and Islamic timekeeping articles.\n\nFor the exact definition, check the official KBBI site at kbbi.kemdikbud.go.id, since this source is a third-party mirror."], "durationSeconds": 5.190394416999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01UL7SoW2mR5MNWebAy4BWFA", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
